# Where the app sends its requests: your website, whose server forwards /api to the API and
# answers sign-in at /api/auth. Built into the app, so set the https address before a release
# build. Blank in development, the app uses this computer's dev server (pnpm dev): at
# http://10.0.2.2:3000 from the Android emulator, http://localhost:3000 from the iOS simulator.
# On a phone, set it to http://<this computer's address>:3000.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=

# clubedge:if auth=supabase
# Supabase Auth's public settings, the same as the website's. No service role key belongs here.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# clubedge:end
